# A unique character. Tag one NPC in game with:  /lowtalk tag elder
# Shows: tag binding, a portrait, once-blocks, per-NPC counters, an objective-gated start,
# notifications, titles, healing, entity effects, and reputation.

npc: @elder
title: Elder Rootbark
speaker: Elder
portrait: Pages/RespawnPageSkull.png

start: after_quest when objective("Objective_Gather") == "complete" and not $rewarded
start: during_quest when objective("Objective_Gather") == "active"
start: greeting

== greeting
<<once>>
  Elder: You are new to the grove. Sit. There is much to tell, and my roots are tired.
<<endonce>>
Elder: The Scarak grow bold this season. We need hands, not words.
-> I can help. What do you need?
    <<jump offer>>
-> Who are the Scarak?
    Elder: Chitin and hunger, mostly. They come from the deep tunnels when the moon is thin.
-> I'm hurt, Elder. <<if stat("Health") < max_stat("Health")>>
    Elder: Then hold still. The grove mends what it can.
    <<heal>>
    <<effect HealthRegen_Buff_T1>>
    <<notify "The grove mends you" "Health restored" success>>
-> Not today, Elder.
    Elder: Then go carefully.
    <<end>>

== offer
Elder: Gather ten fibres from the tall grass beyond the pond. Bring them here and I'll see you rewarded.
-> I'll do it.
    <<objective Objective_Gather>>
    <<set $npc.helpers = $npc.helpers + 1>>
    <<notify "Objective accepted" "Gather fibres beyond the pond">>
    Elder: Good. You are the {ordinal($npc.helpers)} to say so. Let's see if you're the first to return.
    <<end>>
-> What's in it for me?
    Elder: My gratitude, and a bar of good copper.
    <<jump offer>>

== during_quest
Elder: The grass is beyond the pond, {player}. Not here.
<<end>>

== after_quest
Elder: You returned. Few do.
<<give Ingredient_Bar_Copper 1>>
<<reputation +10>>
<<set $rewarded = true>>
<<attitude revered>>
<<anim Wave>>
<<title "The Grove Remembers" "Elder Rootbark counts you a friend" major 4>>
Elder: The grove remembers its friends.
-> It was nothing.
    <<end>>
